{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"The greedy colouring with some colours fixed in advance (rustworkx","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graph_greedy_color(preset_color_fn=)"},{"text":"): ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presetColor"},{"text":" gives a vertex’s colour, or nil to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leave it to the strategy. Preset vertices keep their colours and count as coloured from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"start; the others are coloured as by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(strategy:)"},{"text":", each taking the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"colour no coloured neighbour has. The orders of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".largestFirst"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".smallestLast"},{"text":" and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connected sequential strategies are those of the whole graph with the preset vertices","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"skipped (rustworkx’s largest first: whole-graph degrees, preset vertices left out);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"DSatur counts preset colours in saturation from the start (rustworkx’s saturation);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".independentSet"},{"text":"‘s class k starts without the neighbours of the vertices preset to k","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(rustworkx’s independent set); ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".coloredNeighbors"},{"text":" counts preset neighbours as coloured and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes its first vertex from its heap. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"colorCount"},{"text":" is one more than the greatest colour,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so preset